  "live_defaults": {
    "rebalance_days": 3,
    "schedule_type": "interval",
    "trade_weekdays": [],
    "enabled_sessions": [
      "PM"
    ],
    "sell_time": "14:30",
    "buy_time": "14:45",
    "sell_first": true,
    "order_type": "LIMIT",
    "max_price_deviation": 0.02,
    "max_orders_per_cycle": 20
  },
  "live_config_tips": [
    "「趋势向上 + 单日大跌」是 A 股胜率较高的隔日反弹形态。",
    "跌幅下限 -9% 避免接住跌停板上的标的。",
    "RSI 上限写 55 而不是 40：站上 20 日线的票 RSI 极少低于 40，",
